Models
------

mmBERT-small (https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small), Johns Hopkins University CLSP. MIT License.
  The base of atelier-nano: its first layers and a trimmed vocabulary, fine-tuned by distillation.

Qwen3.5-0.8B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B), Alibaba Cloud. Apache License 2.0.
  The base of atelier-mini. Changed: attention made non-causal, LoRA adapters trained by distillation and merged
  into the weights, a new readout; converted to GGUF and quantized.

pplx-decider-v1.3 and pplx-decider-flash-v1.3 (https://huggingface.co/perplexity-ai), Perplexity.
Apache License 2.0; derived from Qwen models.
  The teachers. Their answers are the labels the students learned from; none of their weights are in the students.


Code
----

third_party/pplx_decider: Perplexity's inference code for the deciders. Apache License 2.0
  (third_party/pplx_decider/LICENSE and NOTICE).

llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), the ggml authors. MIT License.
  Runs atelier-mini. Its llama-server builds are part of the mini's download for Atelier, with their licence.


Data
----

Text from these datasets is in the request pools and teacher labels (the data/ archives of each saved version).
The data/build_*.py scripts sampled, filtered and rewrote it into Atelier's decision requests, and the teachers
above labelled it.

MASSIVE (https://huggingface.co/datasets/AmazonScience/massive), Amazon. CC BY 4.0.
WildChat-1M (https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/WildChat-1M), Allen Institute for AI. ODC-BY 1.0.
Mind2Web (https://huggingface.co/datasets/osunlp/Mind2Web), The Ohio State University. CC BY 4.0.
glaive-function-calling-v2 (https://huggingface.co/datasets/glaiveai/glaive-function-calling-v2), Glaive AI.
  Apache License 2.0.
Synthetic-Persona-Chat (https://huggingface.co/datasets/google/Synthetic-Persona-Chat), Google. CC BY 4.0.
gliclass-v2.0 (https://huggingface.co/datasets/knowledgator/gliclass-v2.0), Knowledgator. Apache License 2.0.
synthetic_zeroshot_mixtral_v0.1 (https://huggingface.co/datasets/MoritzLaurer/synthetic_zeroshot_mixtral_v0.1),
  Moritz Laurer. Apache License 2.0.

